memory-panel = Project memory
cmd-memory-focus = Project memory: show
memory-search = Search the memory
memory-empty = This project has no memory yet. Agents write facts to docs/memory/ and decisions to docs/decisions/ when their instructions describe the convention.
memory-teach = Teach the agents
memory-empty-note = "Teach the agents" writes those instructions into AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md. Then ask an agent to remember something.
memory-facts = Facts ({ $count })
memory-decisions = Decisions ({ $count })
memory-no-match = Nothing matches the search.
memory-no-index = No index: agents read docs/memory/README.md first, with one line per fact.
memory-broken = The index mentions { $file }, which doesn't exist.
memory-stale-days = not updated for { $days } days
memory-stale-undated = no update date (updated)
memory-missing-path = mentions { $path }, which no longer exists
memory-secret = looks like it has a credential: remove it before committing
memory-not-in-index = not in the index
memory-open = Open
memory-delete = Delete
memory-delete-title = Delete this fact?
memory-delete-detail = { $name } leaves the project, with its line in the index. What was already committed stays in git.
memory-cancel = Cancel
memory-delete-failed = Couldn't delete it: { $error }
